WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.620
Hi, I'm Tilly! Let's check on your agents.

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.820
The rail lists every agent, in every session, in one place.

00:00:08.172 --> 00:00:11.532
When one finishes, its work waits for you, marked unread.

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:14.453
If an agent gets stuck, it jumps to the top.

00:00:15.108 --> 00:00:19.428
In the palette, type the at sign and the letter n to find whoever needs you.

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.310
Answer it, and it gets right back to work.

00:00:26.205 --> 00:00:29.245
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
